{"display":"[Pasted text #6 +8 lines]","pastedContents":{"6":{"id":6,"type":"text","content":"I want to build confidence by accumulating small successful experiences of speaking, asking, and sharing in English.\n\nIn the short term, this training helps me externalize my thoughts, questions, progress, and contributions in English more often.\n\nIn the long term, this training is meant to improve my leadership and communication ability by creating more opportunities for communication and reducing relationship or collaboration problems caused by hesitation, lack of confidence, or unclear expression.\n\nThe problem I want to solve is that I often keep my thoughts, questions, or insights in my head because English feels difficult, I lack confidence, or I worry too much about how others will see me.\n\nThe behavior I want to change is moving from silently understanding things alone to expressing my work context, user impact, questions, insights, and progress in short and clear English."}},"timestamp":1779636025030,"project":"/Users/mingyumkim/Study/deliberate-practice","sessionId":"1652522a-77fa-44c3-b393-abe78f3f7089"}
